  close to requirement with a small margin, not ~1.79M samples.
- `PF-4`: reduce avoidable start-to-result latency while preserving the
  1000x100 <= 200ms and 100x1000 <= 100ms measurements.
- `PF-5`: reduce execution time while preserving batch throughput >= 700MB/s.
- `PF-6`: reduce execution time while preserving write >= 10GB/s and read
  >= 20GB/s.
